          "id": "e6_05",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "PEGUAM",
          "text": "Dorang tak nak stadium kosong. Dorang nak bayar setiap bulan.",
          "translation": "They don't want an empty stadium. They want payment every month.",
